        "legal_identifier": "Tennessee DOR Hall Income Tax overview",
        "primary_source": true,
        "program": "individual_income_tax",
        "source_authority": "Tennessee Department of Revenue",
        "source_note": "Current Department of Revenue guidance states that the Hall income tax applied only to individuals and other entities receiving bond or note interest and stock dividends, was repealed for periods beginning January 1, 2021 or later, and must not be reported on a return for any tax year beginning on or after that date.",
